course: dictionary
lesson: 2706
title: One word, several meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. Context, the words around the word, tells you which meaning the writer wants. «A digital camera» takes photos as numbers, but «a digital clock» shows the time as numbers on a screen. Both use the same word in different ways.
explain: Look for clue words. If you see «screen», «numbers» or «online», digital probably means electronic. If you see «maths», «digits» or «07:45», it may mean to do with the numbers 0 to 9. Ask yourself what meaning fits, then swap it into the sentence to check.
explain: «Your digital footprint is the trail of information you leave online.» Here the clue «online» tells you digital means electronic, linked to the internet. Read the whole sentence before you decide what a word means.
fact: Digital means using electronic signals and computers to store, send or show information as numbers, ones and zeros.
fact: A «digital footprint» is the trail of information you leave online.
fact: «Digital time», such as 07:45, shows the time as numbers, not with hands.
fact: In maths, digital means to do with digits, the numbers 0 to 9.
exercise: «Before digital cameras, photos were taken on film.» What does digital mean here? | Made of fingers or toes | Showing the time with hands | Printed on paper | *Using electronic signals and computers to store pictures as numbers
exercise: «A digital clock shows 07:45.» What does digital tell you about this clock? | It runs only on sunshine | *It shows the time as numbers on a screen | It is a very old clock | It has hands that go round the face
exercise: «A digital picture is a grid of tiny coloured squares called pixels.» What is one pixel? | A type of clock | A large camera lens | *A tiny dot of a digital picture | A single number from 0 to 9
test: In a maths lesson, a child reads «digital time» like 07:45. What does digital mean here? | *Showing time as numbers, to do with the digits 0 to 9 | Showing time with hands | Online | Made of fingers
test: Which clue words help you know that digital means online in «Keep your digital footprint safe online»? | keep and safe | *footprint and online | digital and your
exam: «In 2022 a picture made with an AI tool won a digital art prize.» What does digital probably mean here? | Art made with fingers only | Art shown with hands on a clock | Art about the numbers 0 to 9 only | *Art made with computers and electronic tools
